              "line": 988
            },
            {
              "function": "output_wires",
              "file": "<depot>/packages/Redstone/A3bhF/src/assembly.jl",
              "line": 989
            },
            {
              "function": "transparent_container",
              "file": "<depot>/packages/Redstone/A3bhF/src/assembly.jl",
              "line": 991
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Redstone.Library.Constant",
          "docstring": "    Constant(value) -> Constant\n\nA continuous [primitive](@ref g-primitive) that publishes a fixed value, with no\ninputs and no state.\n\nIts one output, `y`, publishes `value` from [stage 1](@ref g-stage-function).\nThe [library component](@ref g-library-component) is stateless, so discrete\nconsumers read it as well.\n\nThe output is [pinned](@ref g-walked) at the parameter `V`, the type of `value`.\nIt carries zero partials under every `Dual` [activation](@ref g-activation). A\nconsumer input declared plain `Float64`, which admits a value with or without\npartials, accepts it as a value that never carries partials.\n\nThe value is a field, not an overridable default. A source set from outside is a\n[root input](@ref g-root-input).\n\nSee also [`Source`](@ref), [`Step`](@ref).\n",
          "locations": [
            {
